Employment Contract between the City of Cheyenne, Parks and Recreation Department, and
Tim Grote for Greenway construction project management services (Greenway 1% Specific Purpose
Sales & Use Tax) -- referred to Finance Committee.  Mr. Valdez advised the item was discussed under
other items for the agenda at Finance Committee and provisions of Title 2 of City Code had been met.
Mr. Valdez moved to approve in an amount not to exceed $37,676.94, seconded by Ms. Ash.  Rick
Parish, Director of Parks and Recreation, requested the item be postponed for two weeks (to Sept. 26,
2011) to allow further review and clarification involving the contract.  Mr. Pierson moved to postpone
for two weeks (to Sept. 26, 2011), seconded by Mr. Brown.  Motion to postpone carried.  Voting “yes”
-- all members of the governing body present with the exception of President Rinne who did not vote.
