[CA]
Contract Modification No. 1 to Contract No. 5414 between the City of Cheyenne, Sanitation
Division, and Clean Harbors Environmental Services, Inc. for hazardous waste disposal services at the
Cheyenne Household Hazardous Waste Facility -- referred to Finance Committee.
Consideration of Bid #R-1-12 for furnishing and installing one new wireless bus lift with four
jack stands for the City of Cheyenne Transit Division.  Upon inquiry, Joe Dougherty, Transit Director,
stated the bus lift system will provide a safer working condition for Fleet Maintenance mechanics.  He
explained that subsequent to the Finance Committee meeting, all Federal assurance documents had
been located and are signed as required.  Mr. Valdez advised a condition was included in the motion
to accept the bid at the Finance Committee, requiring all signatures be obtained regarding Federal
certifications of acceptance; however, since the meeting it had been advised that the documents with
required signatures are in place and the condition is no longer necessary.  Mr. Valdez moved to accept
the bid from Ace Equipment & Supply Co., Henderson, CO, in an amount not to exceed $36,250.00,
seconded by Mr. Spiker.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body present
with the exception of President Rinne who did not vote.
[CA]
Consideration of Bid #R-10-12 for furnishing and installing four steel compaction wheels on
a caterpillar at the City Landfill.  Motion (per Consent Agenda) carried (Wyoming Machinery,
Cheyenne, amount not to exceed $82,857.00).
[CA]
Consideration of Bid #M-5-12 for purchasing a bulk ice control product for the Public Works
Department for use on City streets (2007-2010 1% Sales Tax) -- referred to Finance Committee.
